ike to request an illustration of me and my friend's original characters!\n\n💎 AREVE (162 cm) \nA magic user who creates and controls diamonds that sparkle in the light. She is kind and gentle, and is selfless to the point of being considered a saint. Her hair is white like snow, and her eyes are pale blue like glass.\n\n🫐 JUNIPER (184 cm)\nA magic user who becomes ghostly and intangible like sunlight. He's loud and bright, akin to a golden retriever, or a knight who saves princesses from towers. His hair is light yellow, and his eyes are pale green, with deep blue pupils. He has many piercings.\n\nA scene where they're happy together, out on a boat in the water surrounded by nature, or walking through school hallways with Areve carrying books and Juniper carrying their swords, would be beautiful.\n\nPlease feel free to resend if the amount is too low! Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://geeckek.notion.site/Junreve-1341d0143d07805595d8ce6b77c71041?pvs=4", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mikur_ovog/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/18c3c135/uploads/origins/62239f0b-12e8-431f-954b-8644b668d7ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40de3948b39b7d1714c84d35b37cb8cc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/18c3c135/uploads/origins/62239f0b-12e8-431f-954b-8644b668d7ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40de3948b39b7d1714c84d35b37cb8cc, https://si.imgix.net/18c3c135/uploads/origins/62239f0b-12e8-431f-954b-8644b668d7ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00914b920b8d5d04ee82e97d46d62a3f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/18c3c135/uploads/origins/62239f0b-12e8-431f-954b-8644b668d7ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b271ef230a3d40f92071781a00be66d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作風にとても惚れました！超自然的なアーティファクトを調査し、異世界への扉を開く2人の同僚をお願いしたいです。\nテーマ：骨董品店、猫扉と階段、火と氷、鳥と\n\n🔥 BLAZE (175 cm)\nやんちゃでクールな女の子。スリルを求め、トラブルを起こすのが好き。ある取引で運命を棒に振ったため、衝動的で無謀な行動を止められず、時に危険な目に遭う。\n肌の色と目の下のほくろに注目してください！\nテーマ：炎、溶岩、煙、喪失、執着、追跡、運命、不死鳥（フェニックス）\n\nキャリコ (175 cm)\n猫のような人。飄々としていてイライラしやすいが、表向きは穏やかで気にしていないように見え、形式的には礼儀正しい。普段は他人に冷淡だが、大切な数人には心優しい。彼の運命は研究所と結びついており、それゆえに超自然的な危険と隣り合わせだが、他人の記憶を受け継ぐために生き続けることを決意している。\nそばかす、猫の瞳孔、ツートンカラーの髪に注目！\nテーマ：三毛猫、バニラ、冬、雪の結晶、満月、天の川、オーロラ、雲、毛糸玉、ペパーミント\n\n自由に描いてください！服装は自由です！\n\nhttps://zippy-stealer-c43.notion.site/Blaze-Calico-1dc17861336c8079ba7dcc642a25c8ea", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}